  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "我在ZA登峰战见过你，\n你就是<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115728005A0041767B5CF0621889C18FC74F60FF0C000A4F605C31662F001000020100000054273002001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "身为一个宝可梦训练家，\n我是ZA登峰战的忠实粉丝。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8EAB4E3A4E004E2A5B9D53EF68A68BAD7EC35BB6FF0C000A6211662F005A0041767B5CF0621876845FE05B9E7C894E1D3002001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "每当我想出新的战术，\n都会找ZA登峰战的训练家来当对手试一试。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BCF5F53621160F351FA65B076846218672FFF0C000A90FD4F1A627E005A0041767B5CF0621876848BAD7EC35BB667655F535BF9624B8BD54E008BD53002001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽说如此，这也太奇妙了。\n像你这样的小孩子能如此活跃……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D8BF459826B64FF0C8FD94E5F592A594759994E863002000A50CF4F608FD9683776845C0F5B695B5080FD59826B646D3B8DC320262026001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "难道是ZA登峰战的水准变低了？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96BE9053662F005A0041767B5CF0621876846C3451C653D84F4E4E86FF1F001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用宝可梦对战确认一下就知道了！\n来吧！尝尝我的战术！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75285B9D53EF68A65BF96218786E8BA44E004E0B5C3177E590534E86FF01000A67655427FF015C1D5C1D621176846218672FFF01001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是准备好和我打了，\n就来找我吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F51C65907597D548C621162534E86FF0C000A5C316765627E62115427FF01001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来尝尝我的战术是什么滋味吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67655C1D5C1D621176846218672F662F4EC04E486ECB54735427FF01001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "应战",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E9462180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不要",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D89810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "ZA登峰战的训练家\n不是都很喜欢对战吗？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n那你为什么不愿意和我打啊！？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A0041767B5CF0621876848BAD7EC35BB6000A4E0D662F90FD5F88559C6B225BF962185417FF1F00100001BE00000A90A34F604E3A4EC04E484E0D613F610F548C62116253554AFF01FF1F001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所谓战斗中的攻击，\n可不只是给予伤害而已！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62408C13621865974E2D7684653B51FBFF0C000A53EF4E0D53EA662F7ED94E884F245BB3800C5DF2FF01001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我先让宝可梦携带树果……\n你就通过对战来确认这是怎么一回事吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621151488BA95B9D53EF68A6643A5E266811679C20262026000A4F605C31901A8FC75BF962186765786E8BA48FD9662F600E4E484E0056DE4E8B5427FF01001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "万万没想到，\n我这让宝可梦携带树果的战术<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n居然会被破掉……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果先让宝可梦携带持有物，\n就会根据状况发挥效果！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E074E076CA160F35230FF0C000A62118FD98BA95B9D53EF68A6643A5E266811679C76846218672F00100001BE00000A5C4571364F1A88AB783463892026202600100001BE01000A5982679C51488BA95B9D53EF68A6643A5E26630167097269FF0C000A5C314F1A6839636E72B651B553D163256548679CFF01001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "送你橙橙果，\n作为我们友谊的见证吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90014F606A596A59679CFF0C000A4F5C4E3A62114EEC53CB8C0A768489C18BC154273002001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "携带橙橙果的宝可梦\n在战斗中的HP变为一半以下时，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n会吃掉橙橙果来回复HP。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "643A5E266A596A59679C76845B9D53EF68A6000A5728621865974E2D76840048005053D84E3A4E00534A4EE54E0B65F6FF0C00100001BE00000A4F1A540363896A596A59679C676556DE590D004800503002001000020114018D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "今后我想要试验战术的时候\n会再来请你陪我的！拜托你啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
